# Never commit data dumps — they contain member emails/names.
*-data*.json
*-data*.sql
*.dump
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
# Exception, deliberate: the production build's three values are all public.
# The Supabase URL and the *publishable* key are built to ship inside a browser
# bundle — they are in every visitor's downloaded JavaScript either way — and
# VITE_READONLY=1 is a safety setting, not a secret. Committing them is what
# keeps the deployed build from depending on settings that live only in one
# person's Vercel dashboard. The service-role key must NEVER appear here.
!.env.production
.venv/
/backups/
__pycache__/
dist/
node_modules/
tests/rls/seed-ids.json
.env.test
supabase/.temp/
dist-demo/
